
### `.gitignore`

```gitignore
# ==============================
# Semantics Frontend Website
# .gitignore
# ==============================

# Operating System Files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# IDE / Editor Files
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*.swn
*.bak

# Node.js / Package Manager
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

# Build / Distribution
dist/
build/
out/
.next/
.cache/

# Environment Variables
.env
.env.local
.env.development
.env.test
.env.production

# Logs
logs/
*.log

# Temporary Files
tmp/
temp/
*.tmp

# Coverage Reports
coverage/

# OS-specific files
*.DS_Store

# Local configuration
.local/

# Deployment cache
.vercel/
.netlify/

# Generated files
*.map

# Personal files
notes/
drafts/
